headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
  Cookie: s_r={{refreshToken}}
}

docs {
  # Invern Backend

  ## Setup
  1. Select the **Local** environment (top-right).
  2. Run **Public / Auth / Get Anonymous Session** — it stores anonymous
     accessToken + refreshToken (needed for cart/checkout/orders/account).
  3. Run **Public / Auth / Login (Admin)** — swaps them for a logged-in ADMIN
     session, unlocking every `/private/*` request.

  Both requests set `accessToken` and `refreshToken` env vars automatically;
  the collection sends them on every request (Authorization bearer + s_r cookie).
  `/private/*` requires BOTH a valid ADMIN access token and the refresh cookie.

  Create an admin first with: `npm run create-admin -- --email=... --password=...`
}
